# India-Specific Regex Blacklist for Pi-hole
# Targets Indian ad networks, tracking patterns, and phishing infrastructure
# Updated: 2026-11-08
#
# CAUTION: Monitor query logs after enabling. Some patterns may cause
# false positives on legitimate services. Disable individual rules if needed.

# InMobi ad network (major Indian mobile ad platform)
(^|\.)inmobi(ads)?\.(com|net|in|co\.in)$

# Vserv mobile ad network (Indian mobile advertising)
(^|\.)(vserv(ids|ads|mobi)?)\.(com|mobi|net|in)$

# MoPub (legacy ad SDK, still queried by some Indian apps)
(^|\.)mopub\.(com|net)$

# Generic ad-serving subdomains (catches Indian + global patterns)
^adse?rv(er?|ice)?s?[0-9]*[-.]

# Generic tracking subdomains
^track(er|ing)?[-.]

# Generic analytics subdomains
^analytics?[-.]

# Generic telemetry endpoints
^telemetry[-.]

